h should be equally acceptable to us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/10/enbridge-enb-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENB 2022 Q4","e":"enb","d":"2023-02-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vern Yu","x":"We are reaffirming our 2023 guidance that we provided last November.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/10/enbridge-enb-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENB 2023 Q1","e":"enb","d":"2023-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vern Yu","x":"As Greg mentioned, we're reaffirming our 2023 guidance that we provided last November.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/05/enbridge-enb-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENB 2023 Q1","e":"enb","d":"2023-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Linda Ezergailis","x":"Looking beyond this year and thank you for reiterating the guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/05/enbridge-enb-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENB 2023 Q2","e":"enb","d":"2023-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Greg Ebel","x":"And even where there's elements, which things like the mainline, there's elements of pass-through on power, we want to make sure that whatever that power is, however, it comes that it's cost competitive across jurisdiction in North America.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/04/enbridge-enb-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENB 2023 Q3","e":"enb","d":"2023-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jeremy Tonet","x":"Secondly, most of our, you know, virtually highly regulated assets have some element of inflation and pass-through on interest rates often impacting the return on equity, i.e., Increasing it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/enbridge-enb-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENB 2025 Q3","e":"enb","d":"2025-11-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Gregory Ebel","x":"And a lot of them, obviously, we're avoiding tariff structures through contract mechanisms as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/enbridge-enb-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENB 2025 Q3","e":"enb","d":"2025-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Patrick Murray","x":"I'm pleased to once again reaffirm our 2025 guidance and growth outlook across all metrics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/enbridge-enb-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENB 2026 Q3","e":"enb","d":"2026-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Patrick Robert Murray","x":"Given our strong performance to date and confidence in the underlying business, I am pleased to reaffirm our 2026 guidance and expect results to finish at the midpoint of the range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/enbridge-enb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,11484,0,0,0,9199,1601],[34,1,10312,0,0,0,8404,1335],[35,1,10558,0,0,0,8510,1542],[36,1,10129,0,0,0,8454,1162],[37,1,9565,0,0,0,7735,1282],[38,1,10448,0,0,0,8093,1791],[39,1,10604,0,0,0,8256,1836],[40,1,11336,0,0,0,9155,1698],[41,1,13830,0,0,0,10865,2427],[42,1,13193,0,0,0,11051,1685],[43,1,10811,0,0,0,8851,1341],[44,1,12411,0,0,0,10094,1765],[45,1,10628,0,0,0,8652,1563],[46,1,10637,0,0,0,8557,1597],[47,1,8550,0,0,0,7171,1054],[48,1,10185,0,0,0,8399,1313],[49,1,9123,0,0,0,7375,1315],[50,1,10684,0,0,0,8535,1722],[51,1,10844,0,0,0,8858,1525],[52,1,10998,0,0,0,9160,1332],[53,1,9152,0,0,0,7483,1258],[54,1,10817,0,0,0,8873,1427],[55,1,10521,0,0,0,4010,3608],[63,1,10193,0,0,0,7757,2105],[67,1,11162,0,0,0,9942,755]],"cinema":[[33,1,11484,0,0,0,9199,1601],[34,1,10312,0,0,0,8404,1335],[35,1,10558,0,0,0,8510,1542],[36,1,10129,0,0,0,8454,1162],[37,1,9565,0,0,0,7735,1282],[38,1,10448,0,0,0,8093,1791],[39,1,10604,0,0,0,8256,1836],[40,1,11336,0,0,0,9155,1698],[41,1,13830,0,0,0,10865,2427],[42,1,13193,0,0,0,11051,1685],[43,1,10811,0,0,0,8851,1341